    markdown:
      "## create\n\n`client.airOperations.airTaskingOrders.create(beginTs: string, classificationMarking: string, dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE', opExerName: string, source: string, id?: string, ackReqInd?: string, ackUnitInstructions?: string, acMsnTasking?: { countryCode: string; taskedService: string; unitDesignator: string; acMsnLocSeg?: { startTime: string; airMsnPri?: string; alt?: number; areaGeoRad?: number; endTime?: string; msnLocName?: string; msnLocPtBarT?: string; msnLocPtLat?: number; msnLocPtLon?: number; msnLocPtName?: string; }[]; alertStatus?: number; amcMsnNum?: string; depLocLat?: number; depLocLon?: number; depLocName?: string; depLocUTM?: string; depTime?: string; indACTasking?: { acftType: string; callSign?: string; iffSifMode1Code?: string; iffSifMode2Code?: string; iffSifMode3Code?: string; juAddress?: number[]; link16CallSign?: string; numAcft?: number; priConfigCode?: string; secConfigCode?: string; tacanChan?: number; }[]; msnCommander?: string; msnNum?: string; pkgId?: string; priMsnType?: string; rcvyLocLat?: number[]; rcvyLocLon?: number[]; rcvyLocName?: string[]; rcvyLocUTM?: string[]; rcvyTime?: string[]; resMsnInd?: string; secMsnType?: string; unitLocName?: string; }[], endTs?: string, genText?: { text?: string; textInd?: string; }[], msgMonth?: string, msgOriginator?: string, msgQualifier?: string, msgSN?: string, navalFltOps?: { shipName: string; fltOpStart?: string; fltOpStop?: string; schdLaunchRcvyTime?: string[]; }[], origin?: string): void`\n\n**post** `/udl/airtaskingorder`\n\nService operation to take a single airtaskingorder record as a POST body and ingest into the database. A specific role is required to perform this service operation. Please contact the UDL team for assistance.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `beginTs: string`\n  The effective begin time for this ATO in ISO 8601 UTC format with millisecond precision.\n\n- `classificationMarking: string`\n  Classification marking of the data in IC/CAPCO Portion-marked format.\n\n- `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  Indicator of whether the data is REAL, TEST, EXERCISE, or SIMULATED data:\n\nREAL: Data collected or produced that pertains to real-world objects, events, and analysis.\n\nTEST: Specific datasets used to evaluate compliance with specifications and requirements, and for validating technical, functional, and performance characteristics.\n\nEXERCISE: Data pertaining to a government or military exercise. The data may include both real and simulated data.\n\nSIMULATED: Synthetic data generated by a model to mimic real-world datasets.\n\n- `opExerName: string`\n  Specifies the unique operation or exercise name, nickname, or codeword assigned to a joint exercise or operation plan.\n\n- `source: string`\n  Source of the data.\n\n- `id?: string`\n  Unique identifier of the record, auto-generated by the system.\n\n- `ackReqInd?: string`\n  The indicator specifying an affirmative or a negatice condition for this message.\n\n- `ackUnitInstructions?: string`\n  Specifies textual data amplifying the data contained in the acknowledgement requirement indicator (ackRedInd) field or the unit required to acknowledge.\n\n- `acMsnTasking?: { countryCode: string; taskedService: string; unitDesignator: string; acMsnLocSeg?: { startTime: string; airMsnPri?: string; alt?: number; areaGeoRad?: number; endTime?: string; msnLocName?: string; msnLocPtBarT?: string; msnLocPtLat?: number; msnLocPtLon?: number; msnLocPtName?: string; }[]; alertStatus?: number; amcMsnNum?: string; depLocLat?: number; depLocLon?: number; depLocName?: string; depLocUTM?: string; depTime?: string; indACTasking?: { acftType: string; callSign?: string; iffSifMode1Code?: string; iffSifMode2Code?: string; iffSifMode3Code?: string; juAddress?: number[]; link16CallSign?: string; numAcft?: number; priConfigCode?: string; secConfigCode?: string; tacanChan?: number; }[]; msnCommander?: string; msnNum?: string; pkgId?: string; priMsnType?: string; rcvyLocLat?: number[]; rcvyLocLon?: number[]; rcvyLocName?: string[]; rcvyLocUTM?: string[]; rcvyTime?: string[]; resMsnInd?: string; secMsnType?: string; unitLocName?: string; }[]`\n  A collection that specifies the tasked country, tasked service, unit and mission level tasking for this ATO.\n\n- `endTs?: string`\n  The effective end time for this ATO in ISO 8601 UTC format with millisecond precision.\n\n- `genText?: { text?: string; textInd?: string; }[]`\n  A collection that details special instructions, important information, guidance, and amplifying information regarding this ATO.\n\n- `msgMonth?: string`\n  The month in which the message originated.\n\n- `msgOriginator?: string`\n  The identifier of the originator of the message.\n\n- `msgQualifier?: string`\n  The qualifier which caveats the message status.\n\n- `msgSN?: string`\n  The unique message identifier sequentially assigned by the originator.\n\n- `navalFltOps?: { shipName: string; fltOpStart?: string; fltOpStop?: string; schdLaunchRcvyTime?: string[]; }[]`\n  A collection that specifies the naval flight operations for this ATO.\n\n- `origin?: string`\n  Originating system or organization which produced the data, if different from the source. The origin may be different than the source if the source was a mediating system which forwarded the data on behalf of the origin system. If null, the source may be assumed to be the origin.\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nawait client.airOperations.airTaskingOrders.create({\n  beginTs: '2023-10-25T12:00:00.123Z',\n  classificationMarking: 'U',\n  dataMode: 'TEST',\n  opExerName: 'DESERT WIND',\n  source: 'Bluestaq',\n})\n```",
