      "## list\n\n`client.aircraft.list(firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { aircraftMDS: string; classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; id?: string; category?: string; command?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; cruiseSpeed?: number; dtd?: string; idEntity?: string; maxSpeed?: number; minReqRunwayFt?: number; minReqRunwayM?: number; nominalTATime?: number; notes?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; owner?: string; serialNumber?: string; sourceDL?: string; tailNumber?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/aircraft`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ aircraftMDS: string; classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; id?: string; category?: string; command?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; cruiseSpeed?: number; dtd?: string; idEntity?: string; maxSpeed?: number; minReqRunwayFt?: number; minReqRunwayM?: number; nominalTATime?: number; notes?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; owner?: string; serialNumber?: string; sourceDL?: string; tailNumber?: string; }`\n  General aircraft designation, characteristics, and capabilities. The aircraft schema contains static data of specific aircraft, including tail number, cruise speed, max speed, and minimum required runway length, etc.\n\n  - `aircraftMDS: string`\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `category?: string`\n  - `command?: string`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `cruiseSpeed?: number`\n  - `dtd?: string`\n  - `idEntity?: string`\n  - `maxSpeed?: number`\n  - `minReqRunwayFt?: number`\n  - `minReqRunwayM?: number`\n  - `nominalTATime?: number`\n  - `notes?: string`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `owner?: string`\n  - `serialNumber?: string`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `tailNumber?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const aircraftAbridged of client.aircraft.list()) {\n  console.log(aircraftAbridged);\n}\n```",
