      "## retrieve\n\n`client.airfieldSlots.retrieve(id: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { airfieldName: string; classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; source: string; id?: string; acSlotCat?: 'WIDE' | 'NARROW' | 'HELO' | 'ALL' | 'OTHER'; altAirfieldId?: string; capacity?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; endTime?: string; icao?: string; idAirfield?: string; minSeparation?: number; notes?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; sourceDL?: string; startTime?: string; type?: 'WORKING' | 'PARKING' | 'TAKEOFF' | 'LANDING' | 'OTHER'; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/airfieldslot/{id}`\n\nService operation to get a single airfieldslot record by its unique ID passed as a path parameter.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `id: string`\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ airfieldName: string; classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; source: string; id?: string; acSlotCat?: 'WIDE' | 'NARROW' | 'HELO' | 'ALL' | 'OTHER'; altAirfieldId?: string; capacity?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; endTime?: string; icao?: string; idAirfield?: string; minSeparation?: number; notes?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; sourceDL?: string; startTime?: string; type?: 'WORKING' | 'PARKING' | 'TAKEOFF' | 'LANDING' | 'OTHER'; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }`\n  Airfield capacity data. Contains data associated with the airfieldslots available for parking, working, takeoff, and landing at the airfield, as well as the types of aircraft that can be accommodated.\n\n  - `airfieldName: string`\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `name: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `acSlotCat?: 'WIDE' | 'NARROW' | 'HELO' | 'ALL' | 'OTHER'`\n  - `altAirfieldId?: string`\n  - `capacity?: number`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `endTime?: string`\n  - `icao?: string`\n  - `idAirfield?: string`\n  - `minSeparation?: number`\n  - `notes?: string`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `startTime?: string`\n  - `type?: 'WORKING' | 'PARKING' | 'TAKEOFF' | 'LANDING' | 'OTHER'`\n  - `updatedAt?: string`\n  - `updatedBy?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nconst airfieldslotFull = await client.airfieldSlots.retrieve('id');\n\nconsole.log(airfieldslotFull);\n```",
