      "## list\n\n`client.channels.list(firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; idTransponder: string; name: string; source: string; id?: string; apid?: string; beamName?: string; compression?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; encryption?: string; idBeam?: string; idRFBand?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; owner?: string; pkg?: string; res?: string; sid?: string; type?: string; vpid?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/channel`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; idTransponder: string; name: string; source: string; id?: string; apid?: string; beamName?: string; compression?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; encryption?: string; idBeam?: string; idRFBand?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; owner?: string; pkg?: string; res?: string; sid?: string; type?: string; vpid?: string; }`\n  Channel information on a particular transponder.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `idTransponder: string`\n  - `name: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `apid?: string`\n  - `beamName?: string`\n  - `compression?: string`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `encryption?: string`\n  - `idBeam?: string`\n  - `idRFBand?: string`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `owner?: string`\n  - `pkg?: string`\n  - `res?: string`\n  - `sid?: string`\n  - `type?: string`\n  - `vpid?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const channelAbridged of client.channels.list()) {\n  console.log(channelAbridged);\n}\n```",
