    markdown:
      "## retrieve\n\n`client.diplomaticClearance.retrieve(id: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; firstDepDate: string; idMission: string; source: string; id?: string; apacsId?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; diplomaticClearanceDetails?: object[]; diplomaticClearanceRemarks?: object[]; dipWorksheetName?: string; docDeadline?: string; externalWorksheetId?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; sourceDL?: string; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/diplomaticclearance/{id}`\n\nService operation to get a single diplomatic clearance record by its unique ID passed as a path parameter.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `id: string`\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; firstDepDate: string; idMission: string; source: string; id?: string; apacsId?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; diplomaticClearanceDetails?: { action?: string; altCountryCode?: string; clearanceId?: string; clearanceRemark?: string; clearedCallSign?: string; countryCode?: string; countryName?: string; entryNET?: string; entryPoint?: string; exitNLT?: string; exitPoint?: string; externalClearanceId?: string; idSortie?: string; legNum?: number; profile?: string; reqICAO?: boolean; reqPoint?: boolean; routeString?: string; sequenceNum?: number; status?: string; validDesc?: string; validEndTime?: string; validStartTime?: string; windowRemark?: string; }[]; diplomaticClearanceRemarks?: { date?: string; gdssRemarkId?: string; text?: string; user?: string; }[]; dipWorksheetName?: string; docDeadline?: string; externalWorksheetId?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; sourceDL?: string; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }`\n  A diplomatic clearance is an authorization for an aircraft to traverse or land within a specified country.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `firstDepDate: string`\n  - `idMission: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `apacsId?: string`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `diplomaticClearanceDetails?: { action?: string; altCountryCode?: string; clearanceId?: string; clearanceRemark?: string; clearedCallSign?: string; countryCode?: string; countryName?: string; entryNET?: string; entryPoint?: string; exitNLT?: string; exitPoint?: string; externalClearanceId?: string; idSortie?: string; legNum?: number; profile?: string; reqICAO?: boolean; reqPoint?: boolean; routeString?: string; sequenceNum?: number; status?: string; validDesc?: string; validEndTime?: string; validStartTime?: string; windowRemark?: string; }[]`\n  - `diplomaticClearanceRemarks?: { date?: string; gdssRemarkId?: string; text?: string; user?: string; }[]`\n  - `dipWorksheetName?: string`\n  - `docDeadline?: string`\n  - `externalWorksheetId?: string`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `updatedAt?: string`\n  - `updatedBy?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nconst diplomaticclearanceFull = await client.diplomaticClearance.retrieve('id');\n\nconsole.log(diplomaticclearanceFull);\n```",
