    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.ecpedr.list(obTime: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; ecpedrMeasurements: object[]; obTime: string; source: string; id?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; genSystem?: string; genTime?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; idSensor?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; origSensorId?: string; satNo?: number; senPos?: number[]; senReferenceFrame?: 'J2000' | 'EFG/TDR' | 'ECR/ECEF' | 'TEME' | 'ITRF' | 'GCRF'; sourceDL?: string; tags?: string[]; transactionId?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/ecpedr`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `obTime: string`\n  Time of the observation, in ISO 8601 UTC format with microsecond precision. (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.ssssssZ)\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; ecpedrMeasurements: { obType: string; obUoM: string; chanEnergyHigh?: number; chanEnergyLow?: number; chanId?: string; chanType?: string; chanUnit?: string; msgNumber?: number; obQuality?: string; obQualityIndicator?: string; obValue?: number; species?: string; }[]; obTime: string; source: string; id?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; genSystem?: string; genTime?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; idSensor?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; origSensorId?: string; satNo?: number; senPos?: number[]; senReferenceFrame?: 'J2000' | 'EFG/TDR' | 'ECR/ECEF' | 'TEME' | 'ITRF' | 'GCRF'; sourceDL?: string; tags?: string[]; transactionId?: string; }`\n  Energetic Charged Particles (ECP) Environmental Data Records (EDRs).\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `ecpedrMeasurements: { obType: string; obUoM: string; chanEnergyHigh?: number; chanEnergyLow?: number; chanId?: string; chanType?: string; chanUnit?: string; msgNumber?: number; obQuality?: string; obQualityIndicator?: string; obValue?: number; species?: string; }[]`\n  - `obTime: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `genSystem?: string`\n  - `genTime?: string`\n  - `idOnOrbit?: string`\n  - `idSensor?: string`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `origObjectId?: string`\n  - `origSensorId?: string`\n  - `satNo?: number`\n  - `senPos?: number[]`\n  - `senReferenceFrame?: 'J2000' | 'EFG/TDR' | 'ECR/ECEF' | 'TEME' | 'ITRF' | 'GCRF'`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `tags?: string[]`\n  - `transactionId?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const ecpedrListResponse of client.ecpedr.list({ obTime: '2019-12-27T18:11:19.117Z' })) {\n  console.log(ecpedrListResponse);\n}\n```",
