    markdown:
      "## retrieve\n\n`client.effectResponses.retrieve(id: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; type: string; id?: string; actionsList?: effect_response_actions_list_full[]; actorSrcId?: string; actorSrcType?: string; coaMetrics?: effect_response_metrics_full[]; collateralDamageEst?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; decisionDeadline?: string; externalActions?: string[]; externalRequestId?: string; idEffectRequest?: string; munitionId?: string; munitionType?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; probabilityOfKill?: number; redTargetSrcId?: string; redTargetSrcType?: string; redTimeToOverhead?: string; shotsRequired?: number; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/effectresponse/{id}`\n\nService operation to get a single EffectResponse by its unique ID passed as a path parameter.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `id: string`\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; type: string; id?: string; actionsList?: { actionActorSrcId?: string; actionActorSrcType?: string; actionEndTime?: string; actionId?: string; actionMetrics?: effect_response_metrics_full[]; actionStartTime?: string; actorInterceptAlt?: number; actorInterceptLat?: number; actorInterceptLon?: number; effector?: string; summary?: string; targetSrcId?: string; targetSrcType?: string; totEndTime?: string; totStartTime?: string; weaponInterceptAlt?: number; weaponInterceptLat?: number; weaponInterceptLon?: number; }[]; actorSrcId?: string; actorSrcType?: string; coaMetrics?: { domainValue?: number; metricType?: string; provenance?: string; relativeValue?: number; }[]; collateralDamageEst?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; decisionDeadline?: string; externalActions?: string[]; externalRequestId?: string; idEffectRequest?: string; munitionId?: string; munitionType?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; probabilityOfKill?: number; redTargetSrcId?: string; redTargetSrcType?: string; redTimeToOverhead?: string; shotsRequired?: number; }`\n  A response for various effects on a target.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `type: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `actionsList?: { actionActorSrcId?: string; actionActorSrcType?: string; actionEndTime?: string; actionId?: string; actionMetrics?: { domainValue?: number; metricType?: string; provenance?: string; relativeValue?: number; }[]; actionStartTime?: string; actorInterceptAlt?: number; actorInterceptLat?: number; actorInterceptLon?: number; effector?: string; summary?: string; targetSrcId?: string; targetSrcType?: string; totEndTime?: string; totStartTime?: string; weaponInterceptAlt?: number; weaponInterceptLat?: number; weaponInterceptLon?: number; }[]`\n  - `actorSrcId?: string`\n  - `actorSrcType?: string`\n  - `coaMetrics?: { domainValue?: number; metricType?: string; provenance?: string; relativeValue?: number; }[]`\n  - `collateralDamageEst?: number`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `decisionDeadline?: string`\n  - `externalActions?: string[]`\n  - `externalRequestId?: string`\n  - `idEffectRequest?: string`\n  - `munitionId?: string`\n  - `munitionType?: string`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `probabilityOfKill?: number`\n  - `redTargetSrcId?: string`\n  - `redTargetSrcType?: string`\n  - `redTimeToOverhead?: string`\n  - `shotsRequired?: number`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nconst effectResponse = await client.effectResponses.retrieve('id');\n\nconsole.log(effectResponse);\n```",
