      "## unvalidated_publish\n\n`client.emitterGeolocation.unvalidatedPublish(body: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; signalOfInterestType: string; source: string; startTime: string; id?: string; agjson?: string; algVersion?: string; andims?: number; area?: string; asrid?: number; atext?: string; atype?: string; avgPRF?: number; avgPRI?: number; avgPW?: number; centerFreq?: number; cluster?: string; confArea?: number; constellation?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; createdTs?: string; detectAlt?: number; detectLat?: number; detectLon?: number; endTime?: string; errEllp?: number[]; externalId?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; idRFEmitter?: string; idSensor?: string; maxFreq?: number; maxPRF?: number; maxPRI?: number; maxPW?: number; minFreq?: number; minPRF?: number; minPRI?: number; minPW?: number; numBursts?: number; orderId?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; origRFEmitterId?: string; origSensorId?: string; passGroupId?: string; pulseShape?: string; receivedTs?: string; satNo?: number; signalOfInterest?: string; sourceDL?: string; tags?: string[]; }[]): void`\n\n**post** `/filedrop/udl-emittergeolocation`\n\nService operation to take multiple emittergeolocation records as a POST body and ingest into the database. This operation is intended to be used for automated feeds into UDL. A specific role is required to perform this service operation. Please contact the UDL team for assistance.\n\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `body: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; signalOfInterestType: string; source: string; startTime: string; id?: string; agjson?: string; algVersion?: string; andims?: number; area?: string; asrid?: number; atext?: string; atype?: string; avgPRF?: number; avgPRI?: number; avgPW?: number; centerFreq?: number; cluster?: string; confArea?: number; constellation?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; createdTs?: string; detectAlt?: number; detectLat?: number; detectLon?: number; endTime?: string; errEllp?: number[]; externalId?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; idRFEmitter?: string; idSensor?: string; maxFreq?: number; maxPRF?: number; maxPRI?: number; maxPW?: number; minFreq?: number; minPRF?: number; minPRI?: number; minPW?: number; numBursts?: number; orderId?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; origRFEmitterId?: string; origSensorId?: string; passGroupId?: string; pulseShape?: string; receivedTs?: string; satNo?: number; signalOfInterest?: string; sourceDL?: string; tags?: string[]; }[]`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nawait client.emitterGeolocation.unvalidatedPublish({ body: [{\n  classificationMarking: 'U',\n  dataMode: 'TEST',\n  signalOfInterestType: 'RF',\n  source: 'Bluestaq',\n  startTime: '2024-05-31T21:12:12.123456Z',\n}] })\n```",
