    markdown:
      "## retrieve\n\n`client.engineDetails.retrieve(id: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; idEngine: string; source: string; id?: string; burnTime?: number; chamberPressure?: number; characteristicType?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; cycleType?: string; family?: string; manufacturerOrgId?: string; maxFirings?: number; notes?: string; nozzleExpansionRatio?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; oxidizer?: string; propellant?: string; seaLevelThrust?: number; specificImpulse?: number; tags?: string[]; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; vacuumThrust?: number; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/enginedetails/{id}`\n\nService operation to get a single EngineDetails record by its unique ID passed as a path parameter. EngineDetails are launch vehicle engine details and performance characteristics/limits compiled by a particular source.  A launch vehicle engine may have several details records from multiple sources.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `id: string`\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; idEngine: string; source: string; id?: string; burnTime?: number; chamberPressure?: number; characteristicType?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; cycleType?: string; family?: string; manufacturerOrgId?: string; maxFirings?: number; notes?: string; nozzleExpansionRatio?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; oxidizer?: string; propellant?: string; seaLevelThrust?: number; specificImpulse?: number; tags?: string[]; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; vacuumThrust?: number; }`\n  Known launch vehicle engine details and performance characteristics and limits compiled by a particular source.  A launch vehicle engine may have several details records from multiple sources.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `idEngine: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `burnTime?: number`\n  - `chamberPressure?: number`\n  - `characteristicType?: string`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `cycleType?: string`\n  - `family?: string`\n  - `manufacturerOrgId?: string`\n  - `maxFirings?: number`\n  - `notes?: string`\n  - `nozzleExpansionRatio?: number`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `oxidizer?: string`\n  - `propellant?: string`\n  - `seaLevelThrust?: number`\n  - `specificImpulse?: number`\n  - `tags?: string[]`\n  - `updatedAt?: string`\n  - `updatedBy?: string`\n  - `vacuumThrust?: number`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nconst engineDetailsFull = await client.engineDetails.retrieve('id');\n\nconsole.log(engineDetailsFull);\n```",
