    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.entities.list(firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; source: string; type: string; countryCode?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; idEntity?: string; idLocation?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; idOperatingUnit?: string; location?: location_abridged; onOrbit?: object; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; ownerType?: 'Commercial' | 'Government' | 'Academic' | 'Consortium' | 'Other'; taskable?: boolean; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/entity`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; source: string; type: string; countryCode?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; idEntity?: string; idLocation?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; idOperatingUnit?: string; location?: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; source: string; altitude?: number; countryCode?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; idLocation?: string; lat?: number; lon?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; }; onOrbit?: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; satNo: number; source: string; altName?: string; category?: string; commonName?: string; constellation?: string; countryCode?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; decayDate?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; intlDes?: string; launchDate?: string; launchSiteId?: string; lifetimeYears?: number; missionNumber?: string; objectType?: 'ROCKET BODY' | 'DEBRIS' | 'PAYLOAD' | 'PLATFORM' | 'MANNED' | 'UNKNOWN'; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; }; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; ownerType?: 'Commercial' | 'Government' | 'Academic' | 'Consortium' | 'Other'; taskable?: boolean; }`\n  An entity is a generic representation of any object within a space/SSA system such as sensors, on-orbit objects, RF Emitters, spacecraft buses, etc. An entity can have an operating unit, a location (if terrestrial), and statuses.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `name: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `type: string`\n  - `countryCode?: string`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `idEntity?: string`\n  - `idLocation?: string`\n  - `idOnOrbit?: string`\n  - `idOperatingUnit?: string`\n  - `location?: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; source: string; altitude?: number; countryCode?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; idLocation?: string; lat?: number; lon?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; }`\n  - `onOrbit?: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; satNo: number; source: string; altName?: string; category?: string; commonName?: string; constellation?: string; countryCode?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; decayDate?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; intlDes?: string; launchDate?: string; launchSiteId?: string; lifetimeYears?: number; missionNumber?: string; objectType?: 'ROCKET BODY' | 'DEBRIS' | 'PAYLOAD' | 'PLATFORM' | 'MANNED' | 'UNKNOWN'; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; }`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `ownerType?: 'Commercial' | 'Government' | 'Academic' | 'Consortium' | 'Other'`\n  - `taskable?: boolean`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const entityAbridged of client.entities.list()) {\n  console.log(entityAbridged);\n}\n```",
