    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.gnssObservationset.list(ts: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; ts: string; id?: string; agcState?: number; alt?: number; boresight?: number[]; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; esId?: string; eventId?: string; gDop?: number; gnssObservationList?: object[]; hDop?: number; idOnOrbit?: string; lat?: number; lon?: number; markerType?: string; navigationStatus?: string; obsCodes?: string[]; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; outage?: number; pDop?: number; quat?: number[]; receiver?: string; satNo?: number; satPosition?: number[]; satVelocity?: number[]; srcIds?: string[]; srcTyps?: string[]; tags?: string[]; tDop?: number; trackingStatus?: number; transactionId?: string; vDop?: number; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/gnssobservationset`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `ts: string`\n  Observation Time, in ISO8601 UTC format with microsecond precision. This timestamp applies to all observations within the set. (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.ssssssZ)\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; ts: string; id?: string; agcState?: number; alt?: number; boresight?: number[]; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; esId?: string; eventId?: string; gDop?: number; gnssObservationList?: { agcState?: number; gnssSatId?: string; ob?: number[]; obsCodeSet?: string[]; trackingStatus?: number; }[]; hDop?: number; idOnOrbit?: string; lat?: number; lon?: number; markerType?: string; navigationStatus?: string; obsCodes?: string[]; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; outage?: number; pDop?: number; quat?: number[]; receiver?: string; satNo?: number; satPosition?: number[]; satVelocity?: number[]; srcIds?: string[]; srcTyps?: string[]; tags?: string[]; tDop?: number; trackingStatus?: number; transactionId?: string; vDop?: number; }`\n  Set of GNSSObservation data.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `ts: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `agcState?: number`\n  - `alt?: number`\n  - `boresight?: number[]`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `esId?: string`\n  - `eventId?: string`\n  - `gDop?: number`\n  - `gnssObservationList?: { agcState?: number; gnssSatId?: string; ob?: number[]; obsCodeSet?: string[]; trackingStatus?: number; }[]`\n  - `hDop?: number`\n  - `idOnOrbit?: string`\n  - `lat?: number`\n  - `lon?: number`\n  - `markerType?: string`\n  - `navigationStatus?: string`\n  - `obsCodes?: string[]`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `origObjectId?: string`\n  - `outage?: number`\n  - `pDop?: number`\n  - `quat?: number[]`\n  - `receiver?: string`\n  - `satNo?: number`\n  - `satPosition?: number[]`\n  - `satVelocity?: number[]`\n  - `srcIds?: string[]`\n  - `srcTyps?: string[]`\n  - `tags?: string[]`\n  - `tDop?: number`\n  - `trackingStatus?: number`\n  - `transactionId?: string`\n  - `vDop?: number`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const gnssObservationsetListResponse of client.gnssObservationset.list({ ts: '2019-12-27T18:11:19.117Z' })) {\n  console.log(gnssObservationsetListResponse);\n}\n```",
