    markdown:
      "## unvalidated_publish\n\n`client.item.unvalidatedPublish(body: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; scanCode: string; source: string; type: string; id?: string; accSysKeys?: string[]; accSysNotes?: string; accSystem?: string; accSysValues?: string[]; airdrop?: boolean; altDataFormat?: string; cargoType?: string; centerlineOffset?: number; cg?: number; commodityCode?: string; commoditySys?: string; container?: boolean; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; departure?: string; destination?: string; dvCode?: string; fs?: number; hazCodes?: number[]; height?: number; idAirLoadPlan?: string; itemContains?: string[]; keys?: string[]; lastArrDate?: string; length?: number; moment?: number; name?: string; netExpWt?: number; notes?: string; numPalletPos?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; productCode?: string; productSys?: string; receivingBranch?: string; receivingUnit?: string; scGenTool?: string; sourceDL?: string; tcn?: string; uln?: string; values?: string[]; volume?: number; weight?: number; weightTS?: string; width?: number; }[]): void`\n\n**post** `/filedrop/udl-item`\n\nService operation to take multiple item records as a POST body and ingest into the database. This operation is intended to be used for automated feeds into UDL. A specific role is required to perform this service operation. Please contact the UDL team for assistance.\n\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `body: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; scanCode: string; source: string; type: string; id?: string; accSysKeys?: string[]; accSysNotes?: string; accSystem?: string; accSysValues?: string[]; airdrop?: boolean; altDataFormat?: string; cargoType?: string; centerlineOffset?: number; cg?: number; commodityCode?: string; commoditySys?: string; container?: boolean; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; departure?: string; destination?: string; dvCode?: string; fs?: number; hazCodes?: number[]; height?: number; idAirLoadPlan?: string; itemContains?: string[]; keys?: string[]; lastArrDate?: string; length?: number; moment?: number; name?: string; netExpWt?: number; notes?: string; numPalletPos?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; productCode?: string; productSys?: string; receivingBranch?: string; receivingUnit?: string; scGenTool?: string; sourceDL?: string; tcn?: string; uln?: string; values?: string[]; volume?: number; weight?: number; weightTS?: string; width?: number; }[]`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nawait client.item.unvalidatedPublish({ body: [{\n  classificationMarking: 'U',\n  dataMode: 'TEST',\n  scanCode: '12345ABCD',\n  source: 'Bluestaq',\n  type: 'CARGO',\n}] })\n```",
