    markdown:
      "## unvalidated_publish\n\n`client.itemTrackings.unvalidatedPublish(body: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; scanCode: string; scannerId: string; source: string; ts: string; id?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; dvCode?: string; idItem?: string; keys?: string[]; lat?: number; lon?: number; notes?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; scanType?: string; scGenTool?: string; sourceDL?: string; type?: string; values?: string[]; }[]): void`\n\n**post** `/filedrop/udl-itemtracking`\n\nService operation to take multiple itemtracking records as a POST body and ingest into the database. This operation is intended to be used for automated feeds into UDL. A specific role is required to perform this service operation. Please contact the UDL team for assistance.\n\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `body: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; scanCode: string; scannerId: string; source: string; ts: string; id?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; dvCode?: string; idItem?: string; keys?: string[]; lat?: number; lon?: number; notes?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; scanType?: string; scGenTool?: string; sourceDL?: string; type?: string; values?: string[]; }[]`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nawait client.itemTrackings.unvalidatedPublish({ body: [{\n  classificationMarking: 'U',\n  dataMode: 'TEST',\n  scanCode: 'ABC1234',\n  scannerId: '2051M',\n  source: 'Bluestaq',\n  ts: '2023-03-21T14:22:00.123Z',\n}] })\n```",
