    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.laserdeconflictrequest.history.list(startDate: string, columns?: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; endDate: string; idLaserEmitters: string[]; numTargets: number; requestId: string; requestTs: string; source: string; startDate: string; id?: string; centerlineAzimuth?: number; centerlineElevation?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; defaultCHA?: number; enableDSS?: boolean; fixedPoints?: fixed_point_full[]; geopotentialModel?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; laserDeconflictTargets?: object[]; laserSystemName?: string; lengthCenterline?: number; lengthLeftRight?: number; lengthUpDown?: number; maximumHeight?: number; minimumHeight?: number; missionName?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; platformLocationName?: string; platformLocationType?: string; programId?: string; propagator?: string; protectList?: number[]; satNo?: number; sourceDL?: string; sourceEnabled?: boolean; status?: string; tags?: string[]; targetEnabled?: boolean; targetType?: string; transactionId?: string; treatEarthAs?: string; useFieldOfRegard?: boolean; victimEnabled?: boolean; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/laserdeconflictrequest/history`\n\nService operation to dynamically query historical data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `startDate: string`\n  Start date of the time windows associated with this LaserDeconflictRequest, in ISO 8601 UTC format with millisecond precision. (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.sssZ)\n\n- `columns?: string`\n  optional, fields for retrieval. When omitted, ALL fields are assumed. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid query fields that can be selected.\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; endDate: string; idLaserEmitters: string[]; numTargets: number; requestId: string; requestTs: string; source: string; startDate: string; id?: string; centerlineAzimuth?: number; centerlineElevation?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; defaultCHA?: number; enableDSS?: boolean; fixedPoints?: { latitude: number; longitude: number; height?: number; }[]; geopotentialModel?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; laserDeconflictTargets?: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; id?: string; azimuth?: number; azimuthEnd?: number; azimuthIncrement?: number; azimuthStart?: number; centerlineAzimuth?: number; centerlineElevation?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; declination?: number; elevation?: number; elevationEnd?: number; elevationIncrement?: number; elevationStart?: number; fixedPoints?: object[]; idLaserDeconflictRequest?: string; lengthCenterline?: number; lengthLeftRight?: number; lengthUpDown?: number; maximumHeight?: number; minimumHeight?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; ra?: number; solarSystemBody?: string; sourceDL?: string; starNumber?: number; startDate?: string; targetNumber?: number; targetObjectId?: string; targetObjectNo?: number; }[]; laserSystemName?: string; lengthCenterline?: number; lengthLeftRight?: number; lengthUpDown?: number; maximumHeight?: number; minimumHeight?: number; missionName?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; platformLocationName?: string; platformLocationType?: string; programId?: string; propagator?: string; protectList?: number[]; satNo?: number; sourceDL?: string; sourceEnabled?: boolean; status?: string; tags?: string[]; targetEnabled?: boolean; targetType?: string; transactionId?: string; treatEarthAs?: string; useFieldOfRegard?: boolean; victimEnabled?: boolean; }`\n  The LaserDeconflictionRequest service is designed to process and manage requests related to the safe operation of high-powered lasers, ensuring that laser systems do not interfere with other critical operations, such as satellite based activities. The service facilitates real-time coordination between different entities to prevent accidental exposure to laser hazards, ensuring compliance with safety protocols and regulations.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `endDate: string`\n  - `idLaserEmitters: string[]`\n  - `numTargets: number`\n  - `requestId: string`\n  - `requestTs: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `startDate: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `centerlineAzimuth?: number`\n  - `centerlineElevation?: number`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `defaultCHA?: number`\n  - `enableDSS?: boolean`\n  - `fixedPoints?: { latitude: number; longitude: number; height?: number; }[]`\n  - `geopotentialModel?: string`\n  - `idOnOrbit?: string`\n  - `laserDeconflictTargets?: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; id?: string; azimuth?: number; azimuthEnd?: number; azimuthIncrement?: number; azimuthStart?: number; centerlineAzimuth?: number; centerlineElevation?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; declination?: number; elevation?: number; elevationEnd?: number; elevationIncrement?: number; elevationStart?: number; fixedPoints?: { latitude: number; longitude: number; height?: number; }[]; idLaserDeconflictRequest?: string; lengthCenterline?: number; lengthLeftRight?: number; lengthUpDown?: number; maximumHeight?: number; minimumHeight?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; ra?: number; solarSystemBody?: string; sourceDL?: string; starNumber?: number; startDate?: string; targetNumber?: number; targetObjectId?: string; targetObjectNo?: number; }[]`\n  - `laserSystemName?: string`\n  - `lengthCenterline?: number`\n  - `lengthLeftRight?: number`\n  - `lengthUpDown?: number`\n  - `maximumHeight?: number`\n  - `minimumHeight?: number`\n  - `missionName?: string`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `origObjectId?: string`\n  - `platformLocationName?: string`\n  - `platformLocationType?: string`\n  - `programId?: string`\n  - `propagator?: string`\n  - `protectList?: number[]`\n  - `satNo?: number`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `sourceEnabled?: boolean`\n  - `status?: string`\n  - `tags?: string[]`\n  - `targetEnabled?: boolean`\n  - `targetType?: string`\n  - `transactionId?: string`\n  - `treatEarthAs?: string`\n  - `useFieldOfRegard?: boolean`\n  - `victimEnabled?: boolean`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const historyListResponse of client.laserdeconflictrequest.history.list({ startDate: '2019-12-27T18:11:19.117Z' })) {\n  console.log(historyListResponse);\n}\n```",
