      "## list\n\n`client.laseremitter.list(firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; laserName: string; laserType: string; source: string; id?: string; atmosphericTransmission?: number; beamOutputPower?: number; beamWaist?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; divergence?: number; idEntity?: string; isOperational?: boolean; maxDuration?: number; maxFocusRange?: number; minFocusRange?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; pulseFluence?: number; pulsePeakPower?: number; pulseRepFreq?: number; pulseShape?: string; pulseWidth?: number; sourceDL?: string; wavelength?: number; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/laseremitter`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; laserName: string; laserType: string; source: string; id?: string; atmosphericTransmission?: number; beamOutputPower?: number; beamWaist?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; divergence?: number; idEntity?: string; isOperational?: boolean; maxDuration?: number; maxFocusRange?: number; minFocusRange?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; pulseFluence?: number; pulsePeakPower?: number; pulseRepFreq?: number; pulseShape?: string; pulseWidth?: number; sourceDL?: string; wavelength?: number; }`\n  Model representation of a laser beam emitter/director which represents a source of directed energy.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `laserName: string`\n  - `laserType: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `atmosphericTransmission?: number`\n  - `beamOutputPower?: number`\n  - `beamWaist?: number`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `divergence?: number`\n  - `idEntity?: string`\n  - `isOperational?: boolean`\n  - `maxDuration?: number`\n  - `maxFocusRange?: number`\n  - `minFocusRange?: number`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `pulseFluence?: number`\n  - `pulsePeakPower?: number`\n  - `pulseRepFreq?: number`\n  - `pulseShape?: string`\n  - `pulseWidth?: number`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `wavelength?: number`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const laseremitterListResponse of client.laseremitter.list()) {\n  console.log(laseremitterListResponse);\n}\n```",
