    markdown:
      "## create_bulk\n\n`client.laseremitter.staging.createBulk(body: { classificationMarking: string; laserName: string; source: string; id?: string; altitude?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; laserType?: string; lat?: number; locationCountry?: string; lon?: number; ownerCountry?: string; }[]): void`\n\n**post** `/udl/laseremitterstaging/createBulk`\n\nService operation to take multiple LaserEmitterStaging records as a POST body and ingest into the staging database. This API allows users to create, manage, and review LaserEmitterStaging records in a staging environment before their incorporation into the production UDL. It supports workflows involving validation, review, and approval of emitter data to ensure consistency, compliance, and data quality. A specific role is required to perform this service operation. Please contact the UDL team for assistance.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `body: { classificationMarking: string; laserName: string; source: string; id?: string; altitude?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; laserType?: string; lat?: number; locationCountry?: string; lon?: number; ownerCountry?: string; }[]`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nawait client.laseremitter.staging.createBulk({ body: [{\n  classificationMarking: 'U',\n  laserName: 'LASER_NAME',\n  source: 'Bluestaq',\n}] })\n```",
