    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.observations.obscorrelation.history.list(msgTs: string, columns?: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; corrType: 'OBSERVATION' | 'TRACK'; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; msgTs: string; obId: string; obType: 'DOA' | 'EO' | 'PASSIVE_RADAR' | 'RADAR' | 'RF' | 'SAR' | 'SOISET'; referenceOrbitId: string; referenceOrbitType: 'ELSET' | 'ESID' | 'SV'; source: string; id?: string; algorithmCorrType?: string; altCatalog?: string; altNamespace?: string; altObjectId?: string; altUct?: boolean; astat?: number; corrQuality?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; idParentCorrelation?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; satNo?: number; sourceDL?: string; tags?: string[]; trackId?: string; transactionId?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/obscorrelation/history`\n\nService operation to dynamically query historical data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `msgTs: string`\n  Correlation message generation time, in ISO 8601 UTC format with millisecond precision. (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.sssZ)\n\n- `columns?: string`\n  optional, fields for retrieval. When omitted, ALL fields are assumed. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid query fields that can be selected.\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; corrType: 'OBSERVATION' | 'TRACK'; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; msgTs: string; obId: string; obType: 'DOA' | 'EO' | 'PASSIVE_RADAR' | 'RADAR' | 'RF' | 'SAR' | 'SOISET'; referenceOrbitId: string; referenceOrbitType: 'ELSET' | 'ESID' | 'SV'; source: string; id?: string; algorithmCorrType?: string; altCatalog?: string; altNamespace?: string; altObjectId?: string; altUct?: boolean; astat?: number; corrQuality?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; idParentCorrelation?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; satNo?: number; sourceDL?: string; tags?: string[]; trackId?: string; transactionId?: string; }`\n  Model representation supporting post-pass correlation of UCTs and re-correlation of mis-tagged electro-optical (EO), radar, RF, and DOA track/observations.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `corrType: 'OBSERVATION' | 'TRACK'`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `msgTs: string`\n  - `obId: string`\n  - `obType: 'DOA' | 'EO' | 'PASSIVE_RADAR' | 'RADAR' | 'RF' | 'SAR' | 'SOISET'`\n  - `referenceOrbitId: string`\n  - `referenceOrbitType: 'ELSET' | 'ESID' | 'SV'`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `algorithmCorrType?: string`\n  - `altCatalog?: string`\n  - `altNamespace?: string`\n  - `altObjectId?: string`\n  - `altUct?: boolean`\n  - `astat?: number`\n  - `corrQuality?: number`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `idOnOrbit?: string`\n  - `idParentCorrelation?: string`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `origObjectId?: string`\n  - `satNo?: number`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `tags?: string[]`\n  - `trackId?: string`\n  - `transactionId?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const historyListResponse of client.observations.obscorrelation.history.list({ msgTs: '2019-12-27T18:11:19.117Z' })) {\n  console.log(historyListResponse);\n}\n```",
