      "## list\n\n`client.onboardnavigation.list(startTime: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; startTime: string; id?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; deltaPos?: number[][]; endTime?: string; esId?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; idStateVector?: string; mag?: number[][]; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; referenceFrame?: 'J2000' | 'EFG/TDR' | 'ECR/ECEF' | 'TEME' | 'ITRF' | 'GCRF'; satNo?: number; starCatLoadTime?: string; starCatName?: string; starTracker?: number[][]; sunSensor?: number[][]; ts?: string[]; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/onboardnavigation`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `startTime: string`\n  Start time of the sensor data, in ISO 8601 UTC format. (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.ssssssZ)\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; startTime: string; id?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; deltaPos?: number[][]; endTime?: string; esId?: string; idOnOrbit?: string; idStateVector?: string; mag?: number[][]; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; referenceFrame?: 'J2000' | 'EFG/TDR' | 'ECR/ECEF' | 'TEME' | 'ITRF' | 'GCRF'; satNo?: number; starCatLoadTime?: string; starCatName?: string; starTracker?: number[][]; sunSensor?: number[][]; ts?: string[]; }`\n  These services provide spacecraft positional data derived from on-board navigational sensors.  Navigational points are provided in kilometers and in a user specified reference frame, with ECI J2K being preferred.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `startTime: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `deltaPos?: number[][]`\n  - `endTime?: string`\n  - `esId?: string`\n  - `idOnOrbit?: string`\n  - `idStateVector?: string`\n  - `mag?: number[][]`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `origObjectId?: string`\n  - `referenceFrame?: 'J2000' | 'EFG/TDR' | 'ECR/ECEF' | 'TEME' | 'ITRF' | 'GCRF'`\n  - `satNo?: number`\n  - `starCatLoadTime?: string`\n  - `starCatName?: string`\n  - `starTracker?: number[][]`\n  - `sunSensor?: number[][]`\n  - `ts?: string[]`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const onboardnavigationListResponse of client.onboardnavigation.list({ startTime: '2019-12-27T18:11:19.117Z' })) {\n  console.log(onboardnavigationListResponse);\n}\n```",
