    markdown:
      "## retrieve\n\n`client.onorbit.antennaDetails.retrieve(id: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; idAntenna: string; source: string; id?: string; beamForming?: boolean; beamwidth?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; description?: string; diameter?: number; endFrequency?: number; gain?: number; gainTolerance?: number; manufacturerOrg?: organization_full; manufacturerOrgId?: string; mode?: 'TX' | 'RX'; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; polarization?: number; position?: string; size?: number[]; startFrequency?: number; steerable?: boolean; tags?: string[]; type?: string; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/antennadetails/{id}`\n\nService operation to get a single AntennaDetails record by its unique ID passed as a path parameter. An antenna may have multiple details records compiled by various sources.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `id: string`\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; idAntenna: string; source: string; id?: string; beamForming?: boolean; beamwidth?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; description?: string; diameter?: number; endFrequency?: number; gain?: number; gainTolerance?: number; manufacturerOrg?: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; source: string; type: string; id?: string; active?: boolean; category?: string; countryCode?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; description?: string; externalId?: string; nationality?: string; organizationDetails?: organization_details_full[]; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }; manufacturerOrgId?: string; mode?: 'TX' | 'RX'; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; polarization?: number; position?: string; size?: number[]; startFrequency?: number; steerable?: boolean; tags?: string[]; type?: string; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }`\n  Detailed information for a spacecraft communication antenna. One antenna may have multiple AntennaDetails records, compiled by various sources.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `idAntenna: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `beamForming?: boolean`\n  - `beamwidth?: number`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `description?: string`\n  - `diameter?: number`\n  - `endFrequency?: number`\n  - `gain?: number`\n  - `gainTolerance?: number`\n  - `manufacturerOrg?: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; source: string; type: string; id?: string; active?: boolean; category?: string; countryCode?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; description?: string; externalId?: string; nationality?: string; organizationDetails?: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; idOrganization: string; name: string; source: string; id?: string; address1?: string; address2?: string; address3?: string; broker?: string; ceo?: string; cfo?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; cto?: string; description?: string; ebitda?: number; email?: string; financialNotes?: string; financialYearEndDate?: string; fleetPlanNotes?: string; formerOrgId?: string; ftes?: number; geoAdminLevel1?: string; geoAdminLevel2?: string; geoAdminLevel3?: string; massRanking?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; parentOrgId?: string; postalCode?: string; profit?: number; revenue?: number; revenueRanking?: number; riskManager?: string; servicesNotes?: string; tags?: string[]; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }[]; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }`\n  - `manufacturerOrgId?: string`\n  - `mode?: 'TX' | 'RX'`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `polarization?: number`\n  - `position?: string`\n  - `size?: number[]`\n  - `startFrequency?: number`\n  - `steerable?: boolean`\n  - `tags?: string[]`\n  - `type?: string`\n  - `updatedAt?: string`\n  - `updatedBy?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nconst antennaDetailsFull = await client.onorbit.antennaDetails.retrieve('id');\n\nconsole.log(antennaDetailsFull);\n```",
