      "## create\n\n`client.operatingunitremark.create(classificationMarking: string, dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE', idOperatingUnit: string, source: string, text: string, id?: string, altRmkId?: string, code?: string, name?: string, origin?: string, type?: string): void`\n\n**post** `/udl/operatingunitremark`\n\nService operation to take a single operatingunitremark record as a POST body and ingest into the database. A specific role is required to perform this service operation. Please contact the UDL team for assistance.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `classificationMarking: string`\n  Classification marking of the data in IC/CAPCO Portion-marked format.\n\n- `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  Indicator of whether the data is REAL, TEST, EXERCISE, or SIMULATED data:\n\nREAL: Data collected or produced that pertains to real-world objects, events, and analysis.\n\nTEST: Specific datasets used to evaluate compliance with specifications and requirements, and for validating technical, functional, and performance characteristics.\n\nEXERCISE: Data pertaining to a government or military exercise. The data may include both real and simulated data.\n\nSIMULATED: Synthetic data generated by a model to mimic real-world datasets.\n\n- `idOperatingUnit: string`\n  The ID of the operating unit to which this remark applies.\n\n- `source: string`\n  Source of the data.\n\n- `text: string`\n  The text of the remark.\n\n- `id?: string`\n  Unique identifier of the record, auto-generated by the system.\n\n- `altRmkId?: string`\n  Unique identifier of the unit remark record from the originating system.\n\n- `code?: string`\n  The remark type identifier. For example, the Mobility Air Forces (MAF) remark code, defined in the Airfield Suitability and Restriction Report (ASRR).\n\n- `name?: string`\n  The name of the remark.\n\n- `origin?: string`\n  Originating system or organization which produced the data, if different from the source. The origin may be different than the source if the source was a mediating system which forwarded the data on behalf of the origin system. If null, the source may be assumed to be the origin.\n\n- `type?: string`\n  The remark type (e.g. Caution, Information, Misc, Restriction, etc.).\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nawait client.operatingunitremark.create({\n  classificationMarking: 'U',\n  dataMode: 'TEST',\n  idOperatingUnit: 'OperatingUnit-ID',\n  source: 'some.user',\n  text: 'This is a remark',\n})\n```",
