    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.personnelrecovery.list(msgTime: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; msgTime: string; pickupLat: number; pickupLon: number; source: string; type: string; id?: string; authMethod?: string; authStatus?: string; beaconInd?: boolean; callSign?: string; commEq1?: string; commEq2?: string; commEq3?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; executionInfo?: object; identity?: string; idWeatherReport?: string; milClass?: string; natAlliance?: number; natAlliance1?: number; numAmbulatory?: number; numAmbulatoryInjured?: number; numNonAmbulatory?: number; numPersons?: number; objectiveAreaInfo?: object; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; pickupAlt?: number; recovId?: string; rxFreq?: number; survivorMessages?: string; survivorRadio?: string; termInd?: boolean; textMsg?: string; txFreq?: number; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/personnelrecovery`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `msgTime: string`\n  Time stamp of the original personnel recovery message, in ISO 8601 UTC format. (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.sssZ)\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; msgTime: string; pickupLat: number; pickupLon: number; source: string; type: string; id?: string; authMethod?: string; authStatus?: string; beaconInd?: boolean; callSign?: string; commEq1?: string; commEq2?: string; commEq3?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; executionInfo?: { egress?: number; egressPoint?: number[]; escortVehicle?: { callSign?: string; primaryFreq?: number; strength?: number; type?: string; }; ingress?: number; initialPoint?: number[]; objStrategy?: string; recoveryVehicle?: { callSign?: string; primaryFreq?: number; strength?: number; type?: string; }; }; identity?: string; idWeatherReport?: string; milClass?: string; natAlliance?: number; natAlliance1?: number; numAmbulatory?: number; numAmbulatoryInjured?: number; numNonAmbulatory?: number; numPersons?: number; objectiveAreaInfo?: { enemyData?: { dirToEnemy?: string; friendliesRemarks?: string; hlzRemarks?: string; hostileFireType?: string; }[]; oscCallSign?: string; oscFreq?: number; pzDesc?: string; pzLocation?: number[]; }; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; pickupAlt?: number; recovId?: string; rxFreq?: number; survivorMessages?: string; survivorRadio?: string; termInd?: boolean; textMsg?: string; txFreq?: number; }`\n  Provides information concerning search and rescue operations and other situations involving personnel recovery.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `msgTime: string`\n  - `pickupLat: number`\n  - `pickupLon: number`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `type: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `authMethod?: string`\n  - `authStatus?: string`\n  - `beaconInd?: boolean`\n  - `callSign?: string`\n  - `commEq1?: string`\n  - `commEq2?: string`\n  - `commEq3?: string`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `executionInfo?: { egress?: number; egressPoint?: number[]; escortVehicle?: { callSign?: string; primaryFreq?: number; strength?: number; type?: string; }; ingress?: number; initialPoint?: number[]; objStrategy?: string; recoveryVehicle?: { callSign?: string; primaryFreq?: number; strength?: number; type?: string; }; }`\n  - `identity?: string`\n  - `idWeatherReport?: string`\n  - `milClass?: string`\n  - `natAlliance?: number`\n  - `natAlliance1?: number`\n  - `numAmbulatory?: number`\n  - `numAmbulatoryInjured?: number`\n  - `numNonAmbulatory?: number`\n  - `numPersons?: number`\n  - `objectiveAreaInfo?: { enemyData?: { dirToEnemy?: string; friendliesRemarks?: string; hlzRemarks?: string; hostileFireType?: string; }[]; oscCallSign?: string; oscFreq?: number; pzDesc?: string; pzLocation?: number[]; }`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `pickupAlt?: number`\n  - `recovId?: string`\n  - `rxFreq?: number`\n  - `survivorMessages?: string`\n  - `survivorRadio?: string`\n  - `termInd?: boolean`\n  - `textMsg?: string`\n  - `txFreq?: number`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const personnelrecoveryListResponse of client.personnelrecovery.list({ msgTime: '2019-12-27T18:11:19.117Z' })) {\n  console.log(personnelrecoveryListResponse);\n}\n```",
