    markdown:
      "## unvalidated_publish\n\n`client.poi.unvalidatedPublish(body: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; poiid: string; source: string; ts: string; id?: string; activity?: string; agjson?: string; alt?: number; andims?: number; area?: string; asrid?: number; asset?: string; atext?: string; atype?: string; az?: number; beNumber?: string; ce?: number; cntct?: string; conf?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; desc?: string; el?: number; elle?: number[]; env?: string; groups?: string[]; how?: string; ident?: string; idWeatherReport?: string[]; lat?: number; le?: number; lon?: number; msnid?: string; orientation?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; plat?: string; pps?: string; pri?: number; sourceDL?: string; spec?: string; srcIds?: string[]; srcTyps?: string[]; stale?: string; start?: string; tags?: string[]; transactionId?: string; trkid?: string; type?: string; urls?: string[]; }[]): void`\n\n**post** `/filedrop/udl-poi`\n\nService operation to take a list of POIs as a POST body and ingest into the database. This operation is intended to be used for automated feeds into UDL. A specific role is required to perform this service operation. Please contact the UDL team for assistance.\n\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `body: { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; poiid: string; source: string; ts: string; id?: string; activity?: string; agjson?: string; alt?: number; andims?: number; area?: string; asrid?: number; asset?: string; atext?: string; atype?: string; az?: number; beNumber?: string; ce?: number; cntct?: string; conf?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; desc?: string; el?: number; elle?: number[]; env?: string; groups?: string[]; how?: string; ident?: string; idWeatherReport?: string[]; lat?: number; le?: number; lon?: number; msnid?: string; orientation?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; plat?: string; pps?: string; pri?: number; sourceDL?: string; spec?: string; srcIds?: string[]; srcTyps?: string[]; stale?: string; start?: string; tags?: string[]; transactionId?: string; trkid?: string; type?: string; urls?: string[]; }[]`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nawait client.poi.unvalidatedPublish({ body: [{\n  classificationMarking: 'U',\n  dataMode: 'TEST',\n  name: 'POI_NAME',\n  poiid: 'POI-ID',\n  source: 'Bluestaq',\n  ts: '2020-01-01T16:00:00.123456Z',\n}] })\n```",
