    markdown:
      "## get\n\n`client.port.get(id: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; id?: string; avgDuration?: number; countryCode?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; externalId?: string; harborSize?: number; harborType?: string; idSite?: string; lat?: number; locode?: string; lon?: number; maxDraught?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; pilotReqd?: boolean; portName?: string; shelter?: string; sourceDL?: string; tideRange?: number; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/port/{id}`\n\nService operation to get a single port record by its unique ID passed as a path parameter.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `id: string`\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; source: string; id?: string; avgDuration?: number; countryCode?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; externalId?: string; harborSize?: number; harborType?: string; idSite?: string; lat?: number; locode?: string; lon?: number; maxDraught?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; pilotReqd?: boolean; portName?: string; shelter?: string; sourceDL?: string; tideRange?: number; updatedAt?: string; updatedBy?: string; }`\n  Properties and characteristics of a maritime port, which includes location, port identifiers, and remarks.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `avgDuration?: number`\n  - `countryCode?: string`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `externalId?: string`\n  - `harborSize?: number`\n  - `harborType?: string`\n  - `idSite?: string`\n  - `lat?: number`\n  - `locode?: string`\n  - `lon?: number`\n  - `maxDraught?: number`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `pilotReqd?: boolean`\n  - `portName?: string`\n  - `shelter?: string`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `tideRange?: number`\n  - `updatedAt?: string`\n  - `updatedBy?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nconst port = await client.port.get('id');\n\nconsole.log(port);\n```",
