    name: 'list',
    endpoint: '/udl/poi/history',
    httpMethod: 'get',
    summary: '',
    description:
      'Service operation to dynamically query historical data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.',
    stainlessPath: '(resource) report_and_activities.poi.history > (method) list',
    qualified: 'client.reportAndActivities.poi.history.list',
    params: ['ts: string;', 'columns?: string;', 'firstResult?: number;', 'maxResults?: number;'],
    response:
      "{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; poiid: string; source: string; ts: string; id?: string; activity?: string; agjson?: string; alt?: number; andims?: number; area?: string; asrid?: number; asset?: string; atext?: string; atype?: string; az?: number; beNumber?: string; ce?: number; cntct?: string; conf?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; desc?: string; el?: number; elle?: number[]; env?: string; groups?: string[]; how?: string; ident?: string; idWeatherReport?: string[]; lat?: number; le?: number; lon?: number; msnid?: string; orientation?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; plat?: string; pps?: string; pri?: number; sourceDL?: string; spec?: string; srcIds?: string[]; srcTyps?: string[]; stale?: string; start?: string; tags?: string[]; transactionId?: string; trkid?: string; type?: string; urls?: string[]; }",
    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.reportAndActivities.poi.history.list(ts: string, columns?: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; poiid: string; source: string; ts: string; id?: string; activity?: string; agjson?: string; alt?: number; andims?: number; area?: string; asrid?: number; asset?: string; atext?: string; atype?: string; az?: number; beNumber?: string; ce?: number; cntct?: string; conf?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; desc?: string; el?: number; elle?: number[]; env?: string; groups?: string[]; how?: string; ident?: string; idWeatherReport?: string[]; lat?: number; le?: number; lon?: number; msnid?: string; orientation?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; plat?: string; pps?: string; pri?: number; sourceDL?: string; spec?: string; srcIds?: string[]; srcTyps?: string[]; stale?: string; start?: string; tags?: string[]; transactionId?: string; trkid?: string; type?: string; urls?: string[]; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/poi/history`\n\nService operation to dynamically query historical data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `ts: string`\n  Activity/POI timestamp in ISO8601 UTC format. (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.ssssssZ)\n\n- `columns?: string`\n  optional, fields for retrieval. When omitted, ALL fields are assumed. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid query fields that can be selected.\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; name: string; poiid: string; source: string; ts: string; id?: string; activity?: string; agjson?: string; alt?: number; andims?: number; area?: string; asrid?: number; asset?: string; atext?: string; atype?: string; az?: number; beNumber?: string; ce?: number; cntct?: string; conf?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; desc?: string; el?: number; elle?: number[]; env?: string; groups?: string[]; how?: string; ident?: string; idWeatherReport?: string[]; lat?: number; le?: number; lon?: number; msnid?: string; orientation?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; plat?: string; pps?: string; pri?: number; sourceDL?: string; spec?: string; srcIds?: string[]; srcTyps?: string[]; stale?: string; start?: string; tags?: string[]; transactionId?: string; trkid?: string; type?: string; urls?: string[]; }`\n  A Point of Interest is loosely based on the MITRE CoT (Cursor on Target) schema (https://www.mitre.org/publications/technical-papers/cursorontarget-message-router-users-guide) and provides a simple way to specify a point on the earth for a variety of purposes (tasking, targeting, etc).\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `name: string`\n  - `poiid: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `ts: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `activity?: string`\n  - `agjson?: string`\n  - `alt?: number`\n  - `andims?: number`\n  - `area?: string`\n  - `asrid?: number`\n  - `asset?: string`\n  - `atext?: string`\n  - `atype?: string`\n  - `az?: number`\n  - `beNumber?: string`\n  - `ce?: number`\n  - `cntct?: string`\n  - `conf?: number`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `desc?: string`\n  - `el?: number`\n  - `elle?: number[]`\n  - `env?: string`\n  - `groups?: string[]`\n  - `how?: string`\n  - `ident?: string`\n  - `idWeatherReport?: string[]`\n  - `lat?: number`\n  - `le?: number`\n  - `lon?: number`\n  - `msnid?: string`\n  - `orientation?: number`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `plat?: string`\n  - `pps?: string`\n  - `pri?: number`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `spec?: string`\n  - `srcIds?: string[]`\n  - `srcTyps?: string[]`\n  - `stale?: string`\n  - `start?: string`\n  - `tags?: string[]`\n  - `transactionId?: string`\n  - `trkid?: string`\n  - `type?: string`\n  - `urls?: string[]`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const historyListResponse of client.reportAndActivities.poi.history.list({ ts: '2019-12-27T18:11:19.117Z' })) {\n  console.log(historyListResponse);\n}\n```",
