    markdown:
      "## retrieve\n\n`client.rfEmitter.staging.retrieve(id: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; name: string; source: string; id?: string; altitude?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; extSysId?: string; lat?: number; locationCountry?: string; lon?: number; ownerCountry?: string; subtype?: string; type?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/rfemitterstaging/{id}`\n\nService operation to get a single RFEmitterStaging record by its unique ID passed as a path parameter.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `id: string`\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; name: string; source: string; id?: string; altitude?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; extSysId?: string; lat?: number; locationCountry?: string; lon?: number; ownerCountry?: string; subtype?: string; type?: string; }`\n  Model representation of a nominal RF emitter. This entity contains minimal information used to stage RF emitter entities.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `name: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `altitude?: number`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `extSysId?: string`\n  - `lat?: number`\n  - `locationCountry?: string`\n  - `lon?: number`\n  - `ownerCountry?: string`\n  - `subtype?: string`\n  - `type?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nconst staging = await client.rfEmitter.staging.retrieve('id');\n\nconsole.log(staging);\n```",
