      "## list\n\n`client.routeStats.list(firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; locationEnd: string; locationStart: string; source: string; id?: string; avgDuration?: number; avgSpeed?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; dataPtsUsed?: number; distance?: number; distUnit?: string; firstPt?: string; idealDesc?: string; idealDuration?: number; idSiteEnd?: string; idSiteStart?: string; lastPt?: string; locationType?: string; maxDuration?: number; maxSpeed?: number; minDuration?: number; minSpeed?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; partialDesc?: string; partialDuration?: number; sourceDL?: string; speedUnit?: string; timePeriod?: string; vehicleCategory?: string; vehicleType?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/routestats`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; locationEnd: string; locationStart: string; source: string; id?: string; avgDuration?: number; avgSpeed?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; dataPtsUsed?: number; distance?: number; distUnit?: string; firstPt?: string; idealDesc?: string; idealDuration?: number; idSiteEnd?: string; idSiteStart?: string; lastPt?: string; locationType?: string; maxDuration?: number; maxSpeed?: number; minDuration?: number; minSpeed?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; partialDesc?: string; partialDuration?: number; sourceDL?: string; speedUnit?: string; timePeriod?: string; vehicleCategory?: string; vehicleType?: string; }`\n  General statistics applying to navigation routes utilized by vessels, aircraft, ground vehicles, etc.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `locationEnd: string`\n  - `locationStart: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `avgDuration?: number`\n  - `avgSpeed?: number`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `dataPtsUsed?: number`\n  - `distance?: number`\n  - `distUnit?: string`\n  - `firstPt?: string`\n  - `idealDesc?: string`\n  - `idealDuration?: number`\n  - `idSiteEnd?: string`\n  - `idSiteStart?: string`\n  - `lastPt?: string`\n  - `locationType?: string`\n  - `maxDuration?: number`\n  - `maxSpeed?: number`\n  - `minDuration?: number`\n  - `minSpeed?: number`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `partialDesc?: string`\n  - `partialDuration?: number`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `speedUnit?: string`\n  - `timePeriod?: string`\n  - `vehicleCategory?: string`\n  - `vehicleType?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const routeStatListResponse of client.routeStats.list()) {\n  console.log(routeStatListResponse);\n}\n```",
