    markdown:
      "## unvalidated_publish\n\n`client.sarObservation.unvalidatedPublish(body: { classificationMarking: string; collectionEnd: string; collectionStart: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; sarMode: string; source: string; id?: string; agjson?: string; andims?: number; area?: string; asrid?: number; atext?: string; atype?: string; azimuthAngle?: number; centerTime?: string; collectionId?: string; continuousSpotAngle?: number; coordSys?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; detectionEnd?: string; detectionId?: string; detectionStart?: string; dwellTime?: number; externalId?: string; farRange?: number; grazeAngle?: number; groundResolutionProjection?: number; idOnOrbit?: string; idSensor?: string; incidenceAngle?: number; looksAzimuth?: number; looksRange?: number; multilookNumber?: number; nearRange?: number; obDirection?: string; operatingBand?: string; operatingFreq?: number; orbitState?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; origSensorId?: string; pulseBandwidth?: number; pulseDuration?: number; resolutionAzimuth?: number; resolutionRange?: number; rxPolarization?: string; satNo?: number; senalt?: number; senlatEnd?: number; senlatStart?: number; senlonEnd?: number; senlonStart?: number; senvelx?: number; senvely?: number; senvelz?: number; slantRange?: number; snr?: number; sourceDL?: string; spacingAzimuth?: number; spacingRange?: number; squintAngle?: number; srcIds?: string[]; srcTyps?: string[]; swathLength?: number; tags?: string[]; targetposx?: number; targetposy?: number; targetposz?: number; transactionId?: string; txPolarization?: string; }[]): void`\n\n**post** `/filedrop/udl-sar`\n\nService operation to take SAR observations as a POST body and ingest into the database. This operation is intended to be used for automated feeds into UDL. A specific role is required to perform this service operation. Please contact the UDL team for assistance.\n\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `body: { classificationMarking: string; collectionEnd: string; collectionStart: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; sarMode: string; source: string; id?: string; agjson?: string; andims?: number; area?: string; asrid?: number; atext?: string; atype?: string; azimuthAngle?: number; centerTime?: string; collectionId?: string; continuousSpotAngle?: number; coordSys?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; detectionEnd?: string; detectionId?: string; detectionStart?: string; dwellTime?: number; externalId?: string; farRange?: number; grazeAngle?: number; groundResolutionProjection?: number; idOnOrbit?: string; idSensor?: string; incidenceAngle?: number; looksAzimuth?: number; looksRange?: number; multilookNumber?: number; nearRange?: number; obDirection?: string; operatingBand?: string; operatingFreq?: number; orbitState?: string; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origObjectId?: string; origSensorId?: string; pulseBandwidth?: number; pulseDuration?: number; resolutionAzimuth?: number; resolutionRange?: number; rxPolarization?: string; satNo?: number; senalt?: number; senlatEnd?: number; senlatStart?: number; senlonEnd?: number; senlonStart?: number; senvelx?: number; senvely?: number; senvelz?: number; slantRange?: number; snr?: number; sourceDL?: string; spacingAzimuth?: number; spacingRange?: number; squintAngle?: number; srcIds?: string[]; srcTyps?: string[]; swathLength?: number; tags?: string[]; targetposx?: number; targetposy?: number; targetposz?: number; transactionId?: string; txPolarization?: string; }[]`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nawait client.sarObservation.unvalidatedPublish({ body: [{\n  classificationMarking: 'U',\n  collectionEnd: '2023-04-22T17:38:10.201770Z',\n  collectionStart: '2023-04-22T17:35:00.123456Z',\n  dataMode: 'TEST',\n  sarMode: 'SPOTLIGHT',\n  source: 'Bluestaq',\n}] })\n```",
