    response: 'object',
    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.sensor.calibration.history.list(startTime: string, columns?: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; idSensor: string; source: string; startTime: string; id?: string; azRaAccelBias?: number; azRaAccelSigma?: number; azRaBias?: number; azRaRateBias?: number; azRaRateSigma?: number; azRaRms?: number; azRaSigma?: number; calAngleRef?: string; calTrackMode?: string; calType?: string; confidenceNoiseBias?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; duration?: number; ecr?: number[]; elDecAccelBias?: number; elDecAccelSigma?: number; elDecBias?: number; elDecRateBias?: number; elDecRateSigma?: number; elDecRms?: number; elDecSigma?: number; endTime?: string; numAzRaObs?: number; numElDecObs?: number; numObs?: number; numPhotoObs?: number; numRangeObs?: number; numRangeRateObs?: number; numRcsObs?: number; numTimeObs?: number; numTracks?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; photoBias?: number; photoSigma?: number; rangeAccelBias?: number; rangeAccelSigma?: number; rangeBias?: number; rangeRateBias?: number; rangeRateRms?: number; rangeRateSigma?: number; rangeRms?: number; rangeSigma?: number; rcsBias?: number; rcsSigma?: number; refTargets?: string[]; refType?: string; senType?: string; sourceDL?: string; timeBias?: number; timeBiasSigma?: number; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/sensorcalibration/history`\n\nService operation to dynamically query historical data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `startTime: string`\n  Calibration data span start time in ISO 8601 UTC format with millisecond precision. (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.sssZ)\n\n- `columns?: string`\n  optional, fields for retrieval. When omitted, ALL fields are assumed. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid query fields that can be selected.\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; idSensor: string; source: string; startTime: string; id?: string; azRaAccelBias?: number; azRaAccelSigma?: number; azRaBias?: number; azRaRateBias?: number; azRaRateSigma?: number; azRaRms?: number; azRaSigma?: number; calAngleRef?: string; calTrackMode?: string; calType?: string; confidenceNoiseBias?: number; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; duration?: number; ecr?: number[]; elDecAccelBias?: number; elDecAccelSigma?: number; elDecBias?: number; elDecRateBias?: number; elDecRateSigma?: number; elDecRms?: number; elDecSigma?: number; endTime?: string; numAzRaObs?: number; numElDecObs?: number; numObs?: number; numPhotoObs?: number; numRangeObs?: number; numRangeRateObs?: number; numRcsObs?: number; numTimeObs?: number; numTracks?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; photoBias?: number; photoSigma?: number; rangeAccelBias?: number; rangeAccelSigma?: number; rangeBias?: number; rangeRateBias?: number; rangeRateRms?: number; rangeRateSigma?: number; rangeRms?: number; rangeSigma?: number; rcsBias?: number; rcsSigma?: number; refTargets?: string[]; refType?: string; senType?: string; sourceDL?: string; timeBias?: number; timeBiasSigma?: number; }`\n  The Sensor Calibration service records data about a sensor's overall accuracy and is used to adjust sensor settings to achieve and maintain that accuracy in reported sensor observations. Calibration occurs periodically when needed to maintain sensor accuracy or on-demand to adjust a sensor for a specific reading.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `idSensor: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `startTime: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `azRaAccelBias?: number`\n  - `azRaAccelSigma?: number`\n  - `azRaBias?: number`\n  - `azRaRateBias?: number`\n  - `azRaRateSigma?: number`\n  - `azRaRms?: number`\n  - `azRaSigma?: number`\n  - `calAngleRef?: string`\n  - `calTrackMode?: string`\n  - `calType?: string`\n  - `confidenceNoiseBias?: number`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `duration?: number`\n  - `ecr?: number[]`\n  - `elDecAccelBias?: number`\n  - `elDecAccelSigma?: number`\n  - `elDecBias?: number`\n  - `elDecRateBias?: number`\n  - `elDecRateSigma?: number`\n  - `elDecRms?: number`\n  - `elDecSigma?: number`\n  - `endTime?: string`\n  - `numAzRaObs?: number`\n  - `numElDecObs?: number`\n  - `numObs?: number`\n  - `numPhotoObs?: number`\n  - `numRangeObs?: number`\n  - `numRangeRateObs?: number`\n  - `numRcsObs?: number`\n  - `numTimeObs?: number`\n  - `numTracks?: number`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `photoBias?: number`\n  - `photoSigma?: number`\n  - `rangeAccelBias?: number`\n  - `rangeAccelSigma?: number`\n  - `rangeBias?: number`\n  - `rangeRateBias?: number`\n  - `rangeRateRms?: number`\n  - `rangeRateSigma?: number`\n  - `rangeRms?: number`\n  - `rangeSigma?: number`\n  - `rcsBias?: number`\n  - `rcsSigma?: number`\n  - `refTargets?: string[]`\n  - `refType?: string`\n  - `senType?: string`\n  - `sourceDL?: string`\n  - `timeBias?: number`\n  - `timeBiasSigma?: number`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const historyListResponse of client.sensor.calibration.history.list({ startTime: '2019-12-27T18:11:19.117Z' })) {\n  console.log(historyListResponse);\n}\n```",
