    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.sgi.list(effectiveDate?: string, firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number, sgiDate?: string): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; effectiveDate: string; sgiDate: string; source: string; id?: string; analyzerAttenuation?: number; ap?: number; apDuration?: number; coeffDegree?: number[]; coeffOrder?: number[]; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; ctce?: number[]; ctci?: number[]; dst?: number; dtc?: number; e10?: number; e54?: number; f10?: number; f10High?: number; f10Low?: number; f54?: number; f81?: number; gamma?: number; idSensor?: string; kIndex?: number; kp?: number; kpDuration?: number; m10?: number; m54?: number; mode?: number; normFactor?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origSensorId?: string; precedence?: 'O' | 'P' | 'R' | 'Y' | 'Z'; rawFileURI?: string; rbDuration?: number; rbIndex?: number; rbRegionCode?: number; s10?: number; s54?: number; state?: 'I' | 'N' | 'P'; stationName?: string; stce?: number[]; stci?: number[]; sunspotNum?: number; sunspotNumHigh?: number; sunspotNumLow?: number; transactionId?: string; type?: string; y10?: number; y54?: number; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/sgi`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `effectiveDate?: string`\n  (One or more of fields 'effectiveDate, sgiDate' are required.) ISO8601 UTC Time the data was received and processed from the source. Typically a source provides solar data for a date window with each transmission including past, present, and future predicted values. (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.sssZ)\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n- `sgiDate?: string`\n  (One or more of fields 'effectiveDate, sgiDate' are required.) ISO8601 UTC Time of the index value. This could be a past, current, or future predicted value. Note: sgiDate defines the start time of the time window for this data record. (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.sssZ)\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'; effectiveDate: string; sgiDate: string; source: string; id?: string; analyzerAttenuation?: number; ap?: number; apDuration?: number; coeffDegree?: number[]; coeffOrder?: number[]; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; ctce?: number[]; ctci?: number[]; dst?: number; dtc?: number; e10?: number; e54?: number; f10?: number; f10High?: number; f10Low?: number; f54?: number; f81?: number; gamma?: number; idSensor?: string; kIndex?: number; kp?: number; kpDuration?: number; m10?: number; m54?: number; mode?: number; normFactor?: number; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; origSensorId?: string; precedence?: 'O' | 'P' | 'R' | 'Y' | 'Z'; rawFileURI?: string; rbDuration?: number; rbIndex?: number; rbRegionCode?: number; s10?: number; s54?: number; state?: 'I' | 'N' | 'P'; stationName?: string; stce?: number[]; stci?: number[]; sunspotNum?: number; sunspotNumHigh?: number; sunspotNumLow?: number; transactionId?: string; type?: string; y10?: number; y54?: number; }`\n  Model representation of space weather/solar, geomagnetic, and radiation belt indices.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  - `effectiveDate: string`\n  - `sgiDate: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `analyzerAttenuation?: number`\n  - `ap?: number`\n  - `apDuration?: number`\n  - `coeffDegree?: number[]`\n  - `coeffOrder?: number[]`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `ctce?: number[]`\n  - `ctci?: number[]`\n  - `dst?: number`\n  - `dtc?: number`\n  - `e10?: number`\n  - `e54?: number`\n  - `f10?: number`\n  - `f10High?: number`\n  - `f10Low?: number`\n  - `f54?: number`\n  - `f81?: number`\n  - `gamma?: number`\n  - `idSensor?: string`\n  - `kIndex?: number`\n  - `kp?: number`\n  - `kpDuration?: number`\n  - `m10?: number`\n  - `m54?: number`\n  - `mode?: number`\n  - `normFactor?: number`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `origSensorId?: string`\n  - `precedence?: 'O' | 'P' | 'R' | 'Y' | 'Z'`\n  - `rawFileURI?: string`\n  - `rbDuration?: number`\n  - `rbIndex?: number`\n  - `rbRegionCode?: number`\n  - `s10?: number`\n  - `s54?: number`\n  - `state?: 'I' | 'N' | 'P'`\n  - `stationName?: string`\n  - `stce?: number[]`\n  - `stci?: number[]`\n  - `sunspotNum?: number`\n  - `sunspotNumHigh?: number`\n  - `sunspotNumLow?: number`\n  - `transactionId?: string`\n  - `type?: string`\n  - `y10?: number`\n  - `y54?: number`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const sgiListResponse of client.sgi.list()) {\n  console.log(sgiListResponse);\n}\n```",
