    markdown:
      "## update\n\n`client.sortiePpr.update(id: string, classificationMarking: string, dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE', idSortie: string, source: string, id?: string, endTime?: string, externalId?: string, grantor?: string, number?: string, origin?: string, remarks?: string, requestor?: string, startTime?: string, type?: 'M' | 'C'): void`\n\n**put** `/udl/sortieppr/{id}`\n\nService operation to update a single sortieppr record. A specific role is required to perform this service operation. Please contact the UDL team for assistance.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `id: string`\n\n- `classificationMarking: string`\n  Classification marking of the data in IC/CAPCO Portion-marked format.\n\n- `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'SIMULATED' | 'EXERCISE'`\n  Indicator of whether the data is REAL, TEST, EXERCISE, or SIMULATED data:\n\nREAL: Data collected or produced that pertains to real-world objects, events, and analysis.\n\nTEST: Specific datasets used to evaluate compliance with specifications and requirements, and for validating technical, functional, and performance characteristics.\n\nEXERCISE: Data pertaining to a government or military exercise. The data may include both real and simulated data.\n\nSIMULATED: Synthetic data generated by a model to mimic real-world datasets.\n\n- `idSortie: string`\n  Unique identifier of the Aircraft Sortie associated with this prior permission required (PPR) record.\n\n- `source: string`\n  Source of the data.\n\n- `id?: string`\n  Unique identifier of the record, auto-generated by the system.\n\n- `endTime?: string`\n  Time the prior permission required (PPR) valid window ends, in ISO 8601 UTC format with millisecond precision.\n\n- `externalId?: string`\n  Optional ID from external systems. This field has no meaning within UDL and is provided as a convenience for systems that require tracking of an internal system generated ID.\n\n- `grantor?: string`\n  Identifier of the prior permission required (PPR) grantor.\n\n- `number?: string`\n  The prior permission required (PPR) number issued by the airfield for a sortie.\n\n- `origin?: string`\n  Originating system or organization which produced the data, if different from the source. The origin may be different than the source if the source was a mediating system which forwarded the data on behalf of the origin system. If null, the source may be assumed to be the origin.\n\n- `remarks?: string`\n  Remarks concerning the prior permission required (PPR) for a sortie.\n\n- `requestor?: string`\n  The username of the prior permission required (PPR) requestor.\n\n- `startTime?: string`\n  Time the prior permission required (PPR) valid window begins, in ISO 8601 UTC format with millisecond precision.\n\n- `type?: 'M' | 'C'`\n  Type of prior permission required (PPR) for a sortie (M - Military or C - Civilian). Enum: [M, C].\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\nawait client.sortiePpr.update('id', {\n  classificationMarking: 'U',\n  dataMode: 'TEST',\n  idSortie: '4ef3d1e8-ab08-ab70-498f-edc479734e5c',\n  source: 'Bluestaq',\n})\n```",
