      "## list\n\n`client.surface.list(firstResult?: number, maxResults?: number): { classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'EXERCISE' | 'SIMULATED'; name: string; source: string; type: string; id?: string; altSiteId?: string; condition?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; ddtWtKip?: number; ddtWtKipMod?: number; ddtWtKipModNote?: string; ddtWtKN?: number; ddWtKip?: number; ddWtKipMod?: number; ddWtKipModNote?: string; ddWtKN?: number; endLat?: number; endLon?: number; idSite?: string; lcn?: number; ldaFt?: number; ldaM?: number; lengthFt?: number; lengthM?: number; lighting?: boolean; lightsAPRCH?: boolean; lightsCL?: boolean; lightsOLS?: boolean; lightsPAPI?: boolean; lightsREIL?: boolean; lightsRWY?: boolean; lightsSEQFL?: boolean; lightsTDZL?: boolean; lightsUNKN?: boolean; lightsVASI?: boolean; material?: string; obstacle?: boolean; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; pcn?: string; pointReference?: string; primary?: boolean; rawWBC?: string; sbttWtKip?: number; sbttWtKipMod?: number; sbttWtKipModNote?: string; sbttWtKN?: number; startLat?: number; startLon?: number; stWtKip?: number; stWtKipMod?: number; stWtKipModNote?: string; stWtKN?: number; sWtKip?: number; sWtKipMod?: number; sWtKipModNote?: string; sWtKN?: number; tdtWtkip?: number; tdtWtKipMod?: number; tdtWtKipModNote?: string; tdtWtKN?: number; trtWtKip?: number; trtWtKipMod?: number; trtWtKipModNote?: string; trtWtKN?: number; ttWtKip?: number; ttWtKipMod?: number; ttWtKipModNote?: string; ttWtKN?: number; tWtKip?: number; tWtKipMod?: number; tWtKipModNote?: string; tWtKN?: number; widthFt?: number; widthM?: number; }`\n\n**get** `/udl/surface`\n\nService operation to dynamically query data by a variety of query parameters not specified in this API documentation. See the queryhelp operation (`/udl/<datatype>/queryhelp`) for more details on valid/required query parameter information.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `firstResult?: number`\n\n- `maxResults?: number`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ classificationMarking: string; dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'EXERCISE' | 'SIMULATED'; name: string; source: string; type: string; id?: string; altSiteId?: string; condition?: string; createdAt?: string; createdBy?: string; ddtWtKip?: number; ddtWtKipMod?: number; ddtWtKipModNote?: string; ddtWtKN?: number; ddWtKip?: number; ddWtKipMod?: number; ddWtKipModNote?: string; ddWtKN?: number; endLat?: number; endLon?: number; idSite?: string; lcn?: number; ldaFt?: number; ldaM?: number; lengthFt?: number; lengthM?: number; lighting?: boolean; lightsAPRCH?: boolean; lightsCL?: boolean; lightsOLS?: boolean; lightsPAPI?: boolean; lightsREIL?: boolean; lightsRWY?: boolean; lightsSEQFL?: boolean; lightsTDZL?: boolean; lightsUNKN?: boolean; lightsVASI?: boolean; material?: string; obstacle?: boolean; origin?: string; origNetwork?: string; pcn?: string; pointReference?: string; primary?: boolean; rawWBC?: string; sbttWtKip?: number; sbttWtKipMod?: number; sbttWtKipModNote?: string; sbttWtKN?: number; startLat?: number; startLon?: number; stWtKip?: number; stWtKipMod?: number; stWtKipModNote?: string; stWtKN?: number; sWtKip?: number; sWtKipMod?: number; sWtKipModNote?: string; sWtKN?: number; tdtWtkip?: number; tdtWtKipMod?: number; tdtWtKipModNote?: string; tdtWtKN?: number; trtWtKip?: number; trtWtKipMod?: number; trtWtKipModNote?: string; trtWtKN?: number; ttWtKip?: number; ttWtKipMod?: number; ttWtKipModNote?: string; ttWtKN?: number; tWtKip?: number; tWtKipMod?: number; tWtKipModNote?: string; tWtKN?: number; widthFt?: number; widthM?: number; }`\n  Surface information contains properties related to an airfield's runway, taxiway, and parking. The surface types and characteristics can dictate the airfield's capability of hosting a specific aircraft.\n\n  - `classificationMarking: string`\n  - `dataMode: 'REAL' | 'TEST' | 'EXERCISE' | 'SIMULATED'`\n  - `name: string`\n  - `source: string`\n  - `type: string`\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `altSiteId?: string`\n  - `condition?: string`\n  - `createdAt?: string`\n  - `createdBy?: string`\n  - `ddtWtKip?: number`\n  - `ddtWtKipMod?: number`\n  - `ddtWtKipModNote?: string`\n  - `ddtWtKN?: number`\n  - `ddWtKip?: number`\n  - `ddWtKipMod?: number`\n  - `ddWtKipModNote?: string`\n  - `ddWtKN?: number`\n  - `endLat?: number`\n  - `endLon?: number`\n  - `idSite?: string`\n  - `lcn?: number`\n  - `ldaFt?: number`\n  - `ldaM?: number`\n  - `lengthFt?: number`\n  - `lengthM?: number`\n  - `lighting?: boolean`\n  - `lightsAPRCH?: boolean`\n  - `lightsCL?: boolean`\n  - `lightsOLS?: boolean`\n  - `lightsPAPI?: boolean`\n  - `lightsREIL?: boolean`\n  - `lightsRWY?: boolean`\n  - `lightsSEQFL?: boolean`\n  - `lightsTDZL?: boolean`\n  - `lightsUNKN?: boolean`\n  - `lightsVASI?: boolean`\n  - `material?: string`\n  - `obstacle?: boolean`\n  - `origin?: string`\n  - `origNetwork?: string`\n  - `pcn?: string`\n  - `pointReference?: string`\n  - `primary?: boolean`\n  - `rawWBC?: string`\n  - `sbttWtKip?: number`\n  - `sbttWtKipMod?: number`\n  - `sbttWtKipModNote?: string`\n  - `sbttWtKN?: number`\n  - `startLat?: number`\n  - `startLon?: number`\n  - `stWtKip?: number`\n  - `stWtKipMod?: number`\n  - `stWtKipModNote?: string`\n  - `stWtKN?: number`\n  - `sWtKip?: number`\n  - `sWtKipMod?: number`\n  - `sWtKipModNote?: string`\n  - `sWtKN?: number`\n  - `tdtWtkip?: number`\n  - `tdtWtKipMod?: number`\n  - `tdtWtKipModNote?: string`\n  - `tdtWtKN?: number`\n  - `trtWtKip?: number`\n  - `trtWtKipMod?: number`\n  - `trtWtKipModNote?: string`\n  - `trtWtKN?: number`\n  - `ttWtKip?: number`\n  - `ttWtKipMod?: number`\n  - `ttWtKipModNote?: string`\n  - `ttWtKN?: number`\n  - `tWtKip?: number`\n  - `tWtKipMod?: number`\n  - `tWtKipModNote?: string`\n  - `tWtKN?: number`\n  - `widthFt?: number`\n  - `widthM?: number`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Unifieddatalibrary from 'unified-data-library';\n\nconst client = new Unifieddatalibrary();\n\n// Automatically fetches more pages as needed.\nfor await (const surfaceListResponse of client.surface.list()) {\n  console.log(surfaceListResponse);\n}\n```",
